er membership holder only. Gold membership holder may choose seats for passengers in the booking except saver class booking.\n</p>\n<p>\n** For Sky Team partner flights, please check with the airline's website for more information on allowable weight.\n</p>\n<p>\n*** On domestic flights only the Gold membership holder has access to any lounges and the Silver membership holder has access to Alfursan lounges. On international flights, the Silver membership holder can host up to three family members according to the class of travel. The gold membership holder can host up to three family members and one guest according to the class of travel. Family and guests cannot enter Washington Dulles International Airport Lounge.\n</p>\n<p>\n**** Check out our Partners page for more information on the benefits of our partners and exclusive offers to Alfursan members. Bonus Miles for Reward Miles only\n</p>\n</div></span><!----></p><!----><!----><div class=\"link--text\"><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-title-text-button><!----></sc-placeholder></div><!----><!----></div><!----><!----></div></div><!----><!----></app-jss-columns><!----></sc-placeholder>"}